(o)
provisions of Prevention of Corruption Act, 1988 (49 of 1998);
(p)
procedure for appeal and revision applications under the Act; and
(q)
on line filing of electronic bills of entry and shipping bills vide the Indian Customs and Central Excise Electronic
Commerce or Electronic data interchange gateway (ICEGATE) and Indian Customs Electronic data Interchange System
(ICES).
